{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a town and keep it secure! Enemies approach from all directions, do you have what it takes to stop them? Stroll through town, set up buildings to produce resources, then use those resources to put up defense towers. With a growing collection of towers, bring the fight directly to your enemies. Collect experience points when you defeat enemies, and Level Up to choose bonus abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By collecting Coins you can unlock permanent upgrades to make your characters and towers more powerful. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend the Town is a Rogue Like, base-building adventure in a retro-style fantasy setting.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Success","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3967430/14d0c8e27346d567720dd64be740f90f26958275.jpg"},{"name":"First Level, Part 2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3967430/0e907e16c4c5aefc7331bbb7c2eaa91f567c353d.jpg"},{"name":"Final Beginning","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3967430/e3f007a50dd203faf72d2b33a220d494110cf3b9.jpg"},{"name":"Just Desert","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3967430/3d5e465a3991550240f54cac9d44338d88f8e53c.jpg"},{"name":"Getting Hotter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3967430/272b70c5f620e961d8d02513575c1b5e0d1b5732.jpg"},{"name":"Pharaoh","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3967430/e48c9e91809245408fc7184964a98c695b74ca2b.jpg"},{"name":"Great Plains","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3967430/43eee566359989f0851dfb210221209e87fbbd2b.jpg"},{"name":"Greater Plains","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3967430/91a24d0be5d07c77ec4aff3b2296b1788bb230d4.jpg"},{"name":"Speed Runner